 sends jason todd over the  edge and he's like  no so he kind of pulls this pulls the  gun out right the gun with the rubber  bullets but the intention of just kind  of intimidating  and threatening this guy but when he  does when he goes to shoot him with  these rubber bullets  it's the real gun and he actually guns  this guy down in the city of gotham  so basically he killed tyler's death so  not only did he kill the dad of this kid  now he's gonna have batman breathing  down his neck i don't know about you  guys  but i am hyped for this for the for the  next part of this so with that being  said guys thank you all for watching god  i love jason todd he's such a great  character let me know what you think  down in the comments and i will catch  you all later  peace
 

